SOLUTION 1
    temp 20
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 50 charge

SOLUTION 2
    temp 20
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50

MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10 steps

SAVE solution 1
SAVE equilibrium_phases 1

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file mix_calcite2.sel
    -reset false
    -step true
    -temperature true
    -equilibrium_phases Calcite

END
